\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces  Estimated detectable gravitational-wave event rates, lensed-to-unlensed rate ratios, and prior odds for 2-image, 3-image, and 4-image systems. The total detectable unlensed-event rate is $R_U=448.76\,\mathrm  {yr}^{-1}$, while the total detectable lensed-system rate is $R_L=0.44\,\mathrm  {yr}^{-1}$. The multiplicity-specific rates require all generated images to satisfy the GW detection criterion. The prior odds are evaluated for an observation time of $T=1\,\mathrm  {yr}$. }}{15}{table.2}\protected@file@percent }
